  "bodyHash": "52e6e925442a9189",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff2424\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 僅適用於 Minecraft 1.21+ 版本（</strong>其他版本即將推出！)</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1317260/description_8eb4a846-8a9e-4f84-b4c9-e68231856106.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"806\" height=\"309\"><br></span></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#14eb3f\">🟢 Slimes <span style=\"color:#f05ee8\">+ </span></span><span style=\"color:#999\">&ndash; 48 種史萊姆變體（Minecraft <span style=\"color:#ff2424\">1.21</span> 資源包）</span></span></h2>\n<p><strong>Slimes+</strong> 是一款<strong>原版風格的資源包</strong>，為 Minecraft 1.21 增添了<strong>48 種隨機史萊姆變體</strong>。你遇到的每隻史萊姆外觀都可能不同 &mdash; 不會改變任何行為，僅提供視覺上的多樣性，讓遊戲保持趣味與彈性。</p>\n<h3>🔹 功能特色：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>🎨 <strong>48 種獨特的史萊姆紋理</strong>，隨機套用</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>🧠 <strong>無需安裝模組或自訂實體</strong> &mdash; 完全兼容原版</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>🔄 史萊姆的行為與生成方式與原版一致</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>🤝 <strong>可與 Fresh Animations</strong> 及其他視覺資源包相容（此功能需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>，或需安裝兩個模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files/5982148\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Feature</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features/files/6666192\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Feature</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>📦 即插即用：直接放入資源包資料夾即可</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>為你的史萊姆遭遇增添色彩與驚喜 &mdash; 簡單、乾淨且令人滿意。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>也上架於 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fslimes-%2b-(more-slimes-variants)-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></span></strong></span></p>",
